        {
          "meeting_id": "0571F1",
          "quote": "We had some low-level grumblings about Aegis Detect before March — the alert fatigue issue I mentioned back in, I think it was January — but the outage kind of pushed us to actually go out and look at alternatives."
        },
        {
          "meeting_id": "4B6251",
          "quote": "We had six hours — six hours — where we had zero visibility into our threat environment."
        },
        {
          "meeting_id": "AB668D",
          "quote": "My CISO is now asking me to put together a competitive evaluation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
