      "definition": "Calls regarding technical bugs, export formatting defects, query timeouts, and billing discrepancies arising immediately after upgrading to Comply v2.",
      "distinguishing": "Differs from feature adoption reviews by dealing directly with operational errors, software failures, and billing mistakes requiring engineering patches or credits.",
